  "goodToKnow": "Die Ladung is a load or cargo: die Ladung sichern (secure the load). In physics, it's an electric charge: positive und negative Ladung. In law, eine Ladung or Vorladung is a summons to appear in court. Casually, eine Ladung means a whole lot: eine Ladung Kritik. From laden (to load, charge, also to invite formally). Das Ladegerät is a charger."
